{
  "MeasurementToolMetadata": {
    "Description": "Multidimensional Mood Questionnaire (MDBF), 24 items rated 1 (not at all) to 5 (extremely). Three scales of 8 items: GS good versus bad mood, WM alert versus tired, RU calm versus restless. Negatively poled items must be reversed (6 minus the answer) before summing; each scale then ranges 8 to 40, higher is better. NOTE: item order and keying in this simulated dataset are illustrative and do not follow the official MDBF manual."
